&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:7.8pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・老朽建物の更新、補強&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:7.8pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・設備配置の最適化（電気設備の高所化、浸水防止対策等）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:7.8pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・止水板や土嚢の整備、BCP体制の高度化&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:7.8pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・従業員教育の徹底&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:7.8pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・火災保険の補償拡充&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
